  "details": "sometimes trackers go flat, if you're not on top of the battery charge on them. or sometimes it just turns off because it's obscured. But if you don't realize one of your trackers has gone, and you hit calibrate, or try to calibrate into a new avatar, you are stuck. Your avatar will t pose and stick to it's location, and when you lock in, even if you turn the tracker back on and try again, the damage is done. You can no longer move and are stuck in place. And trying to move with playspace mover doesn't work either. your hip will remain firmly locked to the space where you calibrated.\nOnly thing for it is to re-join the world. Minor annoyance maybe, but it's still an annoyance",
